<section class="section shell principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
  <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
    <span class="eyebrow">The product</span>
    <h2 id="principles-title">The invariant is the <span class="serif gradient-text">interface.</span></h2>
    <p>Change the graph. Keep the guarantee. Axiom makes algorithmic state deterministic, checked, and visible enough to debug.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="principles__grid">
    <article data-reveal><span class="principles__number mono">01</span><h3>Deterministic</h3><p>The same update stream produces the same matching and the same repair path.</p></article>
    <article data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 90ms"><span class="principles__number mono">02</span><h3>Verified</h3><p>Accepted state is exposed only after matching and invariant checks pass.</p></article>
    <article data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 180ms"><span class="principles__number mono">03</span><h3>Observable</h3><p>Inspect matching state, rebuilds, repair scans, and the work ledger directly.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

